{"root":"asumsi","ipa":"/a.sum.si/","core":"指基于某种前提或假设而得出的推论，通常指在缺乏确凿证据的情况下，为了逻辑推演或论证而预设的观点。","pos":["名词"],"scenes":["高频","工作"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/a.sum.si/","zh":"假设，假定","phrases":[{"t":"asumsi dasar","zh":"基本假设"},{"t":"berdasarkan asumsi","zh":"基于假设"},{"t":"membuat asumsi","zh":"做出假设"}],"examples":[{"t":"Asumsi ini tidak didukung oleh bukti yang kuat.","zh":"这一假设没有强有力的证据支持。"},{"t":"Kita harus bekerja berdasarkan fakta, bukan sekadar asumsi.","zh":"我们必须基于事实工作，而不是仅仅依靠假设。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"asumsi","ipa":"/a.sum.si/","zh":"假设","phrase":{"t":"asumsi keliru","zh":"错误的假设"},"example":{"t":"Asumsinya mungkin salah.","zh":"他的假设可能是错的。"}},{"w":"mengasumsikan","ipa":"/mə.ŋa.sum.si.kan/","zh":"假定，假设（动词）","phrase":{"t":"mengasumsikan bahwa","zh":"假定……"},"example":{"t":"Jangan mengasumsikan hal-hal yang belum pasti.","zh":"不要对不确定的事情做出假设。"}},{"w":"asumtif","ipa":"/a.sum.tif/","zh":"假设性的","phrase":{"t":"pertanyaan asumtif","zh":"假设性问题"},"example":{"t":"Argumennya bersifat asumtif.","zh":"他的论点具有假设性。"}}],"derSlugs":["asumsi","mengasumsikan","asumtif"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:33:20.341Z","src":"base"}